<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Mozambique's Petromoc tenders for oil products.</title>
<headline>Mozambique's Petromoc tenders for oil products.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mozambique's Empresa Nacional Petroleos de Mocambique (Petromoc) said on Wednesday it was tendering to buy oil products on behalf of the country's oil distributors.  </p>
<p>The concern said it was seeking sealed bids on a CIF basis for 120,000 tonnes of gas oil, 21,000 tonnes of motor gasoline, 21,000 tonnes of jet fuel and 6,000 tonnes of fuel oil.</p>
<p>The closing date for bids, which require a $500,000 security, is March 27.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
